  "html": "<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_1e01ac7897be4129871e93a78bd6a705~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_2160,h_3840,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_1e01ac7897be4129871e93a78bd6a705~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>These funky oatmeal cookies are delightfully soft and chewy! They only require some mundane ingredients, and the technique behind them in quite simple as well. </span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>NOTE: Before you get mad at me for creating such a silly name for such scrumptious cookies, I assure you that you'll forget all about the name once you try them. They will fertilize your taste buds, for sure! (alright, enough potty jokes)</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Let's get into the recipe!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Ingredients:</span></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>1 cup flour</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>1 teaspoon baking powder</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>½ teaspoon baking soda</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>¼ teaspoon salt</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>½ teaspoon cinnamon</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><u><span>1 hot chocolate packet</span></u></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><u><span>1 instant oatmeal packet</span></u></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span> ½ cup butter</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>½ cup brown sugar</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>¼ cup white sugar</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>1 egg</span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>1 teaspoon vanilla extract </span></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><u><span>1 box of raisins </span></u></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Step one:</span></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Preheat an oven to 350 degrees Fahrenheit. Place parchment paper on two baking trays. </span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Step two:</span></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Combine flour, rising agents, salt, cinnamon, and hot chocolate powder in a medium sized mixing bowl.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_0f7b4273ae3744a0bacf78885ff22360~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3840,h_2160,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_0f7b4273ae3744a0bacf78885ff22360~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Then, gently mix in the contents of the oatmeal packet. </span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_1f8559e5f47d4787963e235818f94c6f~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3840,h_2160,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_1f8559e5f47d4787963e235818f94c6f~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Step three:</span></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Cream sugar and butter in a large mixing bowl with a hand mixer until light and smooth.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_3ebb421d1c5a457fb2fdd3493402ce18~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3840,h_2160,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_3ebb421d1c5a457fb2fdd3493402ce18~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Add the egg &amp; vanilla and blend once more.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_f9234970b8e5443b9b1a8b7ed902a11b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3840,h_2160,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_f9234970b8e5443b9b1a8b7ed902a11b~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Step four:</span></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Stir the dry ingredients into the wet mixture</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_f33261683f9f48949970f6f48e81031c~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3840,h_2160,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_f33261683f9f48949970f6f48e81031c~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Step five:</span></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Carefully fold in the raisins.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_20168e1ae8e748d3939a627d7940acf1~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3840,h_2160,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_20168e1ae8e748d3939a627d7940acf1~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Finished dough:</span></p>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_94a1321415214d9396378231402f3c82~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_3840,h_2160,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_94a1321415214d9396378231402f3c82~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Step six:</span></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Create table-spoon sized balls of dough. Place them on a parchment rimmed baking sheet and set each ball 2 inches away from one another.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_fa40b14c86014caa8ca54234c077d3f9~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_2160,h_3840,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_fa40b14c86014caa8ca54234c077d3f9~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Step seven:</span></strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Bake in a preheated oven for 8 minutes; let them cool for another before enjoying.</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_bb9ae8bec703439d8507b8fed362dacb~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_2160,h_3840,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_bb9ae8bec703439d8507b8fed362dacb~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><span>Recipe card:</span></strong></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div><div><figure><div><div><img src=\"/static.wixstatic.com/media/e92ca0_94461828ad0f4b65a1feabf2c5a279b0~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_861,h_478,al_c,q_90/e92ca0_94461828ad0f4b65a1feabf2c5a279b0~mv2.png\" alt=\"\" draggable=\"false\"></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Expand image\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 19 19\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M15.071 8.371V4.585l-4.355 4.356a.2.2 0 0 1-.283 0l-.374-.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0-.283l4.356-4.355h-3.786a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2V3.2c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2H16v5.371a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2h-.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2-.2zm-6.5 6.9v.529a.2.2 0 0 1-.2.2H3v-5.371c0-.11.09-.2.2-.2h.529c.11 0 .2.09.2.2v3.786l4.355-4.356a.2.2 0 0 1 .283 0l.374.374a.2.2 0 0 1 0 .283L4.585 15.07h3.786c.11 0 .2.09.2.2z\" fill=\"#000\" fill-rule=\"nonzero\"></path></svg></button></div></figure></div></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span>Happy baking (+ munching)!</span></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>\n<div dir=\"auto\"><br role=\"presentation\"></div>"
}
